          "_name": "news06",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"news06\" group=\"News\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen, 'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n    <header>Image</header>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Height\" name=\"imageHeight\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"7\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline name=\"imageWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"8\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\" checked>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Main Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Price\" name=\"showPrice\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n    <header>Color</header>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"rowColor\" value=\"#000000\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/nick-moore-5zwn8dtneva-unsplash.jpg-2000x3556.jpeg\" selected parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\">\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#000000\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 mb-5 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mbr-section-maintitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-maintitle\">\n          <b>Il Team</b></h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-0 mt-4 mbr-section-mainsubtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-mainsubtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Praesent vitae erat. Integer aliquam, lorem\n          vitae dapibus sollicitudin, nibh nisl egestas enim, ut dapibus odio augue tempus venenatis mi\n          semper.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center item features-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 \">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n              <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2025-06-21-arese-music-match-11.jpg-3-1256x837.jpeg\" alt=\"marco lastella ingegnere del suono\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg col-md-12\">\n              <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                  <b><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcolastella/\" class=\"text-primary\">Marco Lastella</a></b></h5>\n                <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\"><i><b>\n                  Audio &amp; Lighting Egineer</b></i></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">\n                  Come co-fondatore di <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\">ML Production</a>, la mia energia si riversa in ogni aspetto tecnico e creativo dei nostri progetti. Ho sviluppato una profonda comprensione delle dinamiche legate <b>all'audio e alla produzione di spettacoli</b>, eventi e concerti. La mia formazione e la mia esperienza mi hanno permesso di acquisire una sensibilità particolare per le sfumature sonore e visive, anche <b>come musicista</b> oltre che da tecnico. Ogni aspetto per me è importante, per primo il rapporto con le persone.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcolastella/\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\" target=\"_blank\">Scopri di più</a></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center item features-image\">\n      <div class=\"col-12\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12 col-lg-{{imageWidth}} image-wrapper\">\n              <img class=\"w-100\" src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/2025-06-21-arese-music-match-25.jpg-1256x837.jpeg\" alt=\"luca mazzola ml production\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg col-md-12\">\n              <div class=\"text-wrapper align-left\">\n                <h5 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n                  <b>Luca Mazzola</b></h5>\n                <p class=\"price mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showPrice\" data-app-selector=\".price\"><b><i>\n                  Audio, Light &amp; Video Director</i></b></p>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Quando ho fondato <a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-primary\" style>ML Production</a> con Marco, il mio obiettivo era chiaro: elevare lo standard tecnico di ogni singolo evento. Dopo anni trascorsi sul campo, acquisendo una profonda conoscenza e dimestichezza con ogni aspetto tecnico, ho deciso di prendere in mano le mie grandi passioni. Ho voluto trasformare la mia esperienza diretta in un impegno in prima persona per la realizzazione di eventi e la produzione video, assicurando sempre il massimo della qualità e dell'innovazione.</p>\n                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn mt-3\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-lg btn-primary\" href=\"mailto:info@mlproduction.it\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Scopri di più</a></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
